    <<lanSwitch 'A movement beneath the blanket wakes you before the temple stirs.' '被子里传来动静。神殿还没醒，你却先睁开了眼。'>>
    <br><br>
    <<icon 'temple/sydney-bed.png'>><<lanLink ["Open your eyes", "睁开眼"] 'Deadwood Reblooms Sydney Dorm Night Wake'>><</lanLink>>
  <<else>>
  <<if $nightmares gte 1 and $controlled is 0>>
    <<nightmareWake>>
  <<elseif !$wakingEffect>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        The temple begins to stir.
        <br><br>
        <<if _sirrisMorning>>
          Sydney has folded the blanket and is waiting by the entrance; Sirris has arrived outside.
        <<elseif _sydneyResting>>
          Sydney is still beside you, holding a book open without turning the page.
        <<elseif _sydneyWorking>>
          Sydney has gone to work, carrying laundry and cleaning supplies through the quarters.
        <<else>>
          Sydney has already gone to <<his>> duties. <<He>> left the blanket neatly folded at the foot of the bunk.
        <</if>>
        <<if _sydneyResting>>
          <br><br>
          <<if _sydneyStatus.includes('pure')>>
            "I didn't want to wake you," <<he>> says, putting the book down.
          <<elseif _sydneyStatus.includes('corrupt')>>
            "I was wondering how long you'd stay," <<he>> says, smiling as you open your eyes.
          <<else>>
            "Morning," <<he>> says, saving your place beside <<him>>.
          <</if>>
        <</if>>
      <<option 'CN'>>
        神殿渐渐热闹起来。
        <br><br>
        <<if _sirrisMorning>>
          悉尼已经叠好毯子，在入口等你。西里斯到了门外。
        <<elseif _sydneyResting>>
          悉尼还在你身边，翻开一本书，却始终没翻到下一页。
        <<elseif _sydneyWorking>>
          悉尼已经去忙差事，拎着衣物和清洁用品在宿舍区域进出。
        <<else>>
          悉尼已经去忙今天的差事，毯子整齐地叠在床尾。
        <</if>>
        <<if _sydneyResting>>
          <br><br>
          <<if _sydneyStatus.includes('pure')>>
            “我不想吵醒你。”<<he>>放下书说。
          <<elseif _sydneyStatus.includes('corrupt')>>
            “我还在想，你会睡到什么时候。”你睁开眼时，<<he>>笑了。
          <<else>>
            “早上好。”<<he>>说，仍给你留着身旁的位置。
          <</if>>
        <</if>>
    <</language>>
    <br><br>
  <</if>>
  <<sleepeffects>>
  <<set $wardrobe_location to 'temple'>><<wardrobeSelection true>><<radiooutfits>>
  <br><br>
  <<if _sirrisMorning>>
    <<lanLink '和悉尼去见西里斯' 'Deadwood Reblooms Sydney Halloween Morning'>><</lanLink>><br>
  <</if>>
  <<lanLink ["Continue","继续"] 'Deadwood Reblooms Sydney Dorm'>><</lanLink>>
  <</if>>
  <<set $phase to 0>>
<</if>>

:: Deadwood Reblooms Sydney Dorm Night Wake []
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'temple'>><<temple_effects>><<effects>>
<<sydneySchedule>><<run statusCheck('Sydney')>>
<<if !_sydneyResting or !isLoveInterest('Sydney')>>
  <<lanSwitch 'Sydney has left for work. The bunk is quiet.' '悉尼已经去忙差事了。床铺安静下来。'>>
  <br><br>
  <<getouticon>><<lanLink '离开床铺' 'Deadwood Reblooms Sydney Dorm'>><<set $sleephour to 0>><</lanLink>>
<<else>>
  <<npc Sydney>><<person1>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Sydney murmurs in <<his>> sleep. The bunk creaks as <<he>> turns toward you. When you open your eyes, <<he>> wakes too and draws the blanket over your shoulders.
      <br><br>
      <<if _sydneyStatus.includes('pure')>>
        "<span class='teal'>Did I wake you?</span>" <<he>> whispers. The other residents are still asleep.
      <<elseif _sydneyStatus.includes('corrupt')>>
        Sydney brushes your hand beneath the blanket. "<span class='teal'>Are you all right?</span>" <<he>> asks quietly.
      <<else>>
        "I thought I heard someone," <<he>> says. <<He>> listens to the quiet room, then smiles at you.
      <</if>>
    <<option 'CN'>>
      悉尼在梦里低声说着话，翻身时床铺轻轻一响。你睁开眼，<<he>>也醒了，把毯子拉回你的肩头。
      <br><br>
      <<if _sydneyStatus.includes('pure')>>
        “<span class='teal'>我吵醒你了吗？</span>”<<he>>小声问。其他住客还睡着。
      <<elseif _sydneyStatus.includes('corrupt')>>
        悉尼在被子底下碰了碰你的手。“<span class='teal'>你还好吗？</span>”<<he>>轻声问。
      <<else>>
        “我还以为听见有人来了。”<<he>>说。<<He>>听了一会儿，见屋里安静，才朝你笑。
      <</if>>
  <</language>>
  <br><br>
  <<loveicon>>
  <<lanLink '提议与悉尼亲密' 'Deadwood Reblooms Sydney Dorm Intimacy'>>
    <<set $sleephour to 0>>
    <<set $SydneyExpansion.dormScene to 'night'>><<set $sexstart to 1>>
  <</lanLink>><<promiscuous1>><<kissvirginitywarning>><<NPCvirginitywarning 'Sydney' 'kiss'>><br>
  <<icon 'temple/sydney-bed.png'>>
  <<lanLink ["Go back to sleep", "继续睡觉"] 'Deadwood Reblooms Sydney Dorm Sleep'>><</lanLink>><br>
  <<getouticon>>
  <<lanLink '离开床铺' 'Deadwood Reblooms Sydney Dorm'>>
    <<set $sleephour to 0>>
  <</lanLink>>
<</if>>

:: Deadwood Reblooms Sydney Halloween Morning []
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'temple'>><<temple_effects>><<effects>>
<<npc Sydney 1>><<person1>><<npc Sirris 2>><<person2>><<run statusCheck('Sydney')>>
<<set $SydneyExpansion.sirrisHalloweenVisitYear to Time.year>>
<<set _templeMember to ['initiate', 'monk', 'priest'].includes($temple_rank)>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    A car pulls up outside the temple. Sirris climbs the steps while Sydney folds away the blanket.
    <br><br>
    <<if Time.schoolDay>>
      "There's school today," Sirris says. "Sydney needs to get ready before the first lesson. I can take you both there."
    <<else>>
      Sirris has brought breakfast for Sydney. "I thought you'd be busy here again today," Sirris says. Sydney nods; the temple's morning work is already waiting.
    <</if>>
    <br><br>
    <<if $sydneySeen?.includes('parent')>>
      <<if _templeMember>>
        "Thank you for helping here last night."
      <<else>>
        "You stayed too?"
      <</if>>
    <<else>>
      Sydney introduces you. Sirris looks from the extinguished lantern to the two of you
      <<if Time.schoolDay>>
        , then offers you a ride as well
      <</if>>
      .
    <</if>>
    <br><br>
    <<if _sydneyStatus.includes('corrupt')>>
      Sydney steps close to you. "I wasn't alone," <<nnpc_he "Sydney">> tells Sirris, with a smile meant for you.
    <<elseif _sydneyStatus.includes('pure')>>
      Sydney puts the lantern away. "They helped me last night," <<nnpc_he "Sydney">> says, looking pleased that you stayed.
    <<else>>
      Sydney picks up <<nnpc_his "Sydney">> books. "The night went quickly with some company," <<nnpc_he "Sydney">> says.
    <</if>>
  <<option 'CN'>>
    一辆车停在神殿门外。悉尼收起毯子时，西里斯走上台阶。
    <br><br>
    <<if Time.schoolDay>>
      “今天还要上课。”西里斯说，“悉尼得赶在第一节课前准备好。我可以送你们一起过去。”
    <<else>>
      西里斯给悉尼带来了早餐。“我想你今天还得在这里忙。”西里斯说。悉尼点点头，神殿的晨间事务已经在等着<<nnpc_him "Sydney">>了。
    <</if>>
    <br><br>
    <<if $sydneySeen?.includes('parent')>>
      <<if _templeMember>>
        “昨晚辛苦你在这里帮忙了。”
      <<else>>
        “你也留在这里了？”
      <</if>>
    <<else>>
      悉尼向西里斯介绍了你。西里斯看了看熄灭的灯笼，又看向你们
      <<if Time.schoolDay>>
        ，提出也送你一程
      <</if>>
      。
    <</if>>
    <br><br>
    <<if _sydneyStatus.includes('corrupt')>>
      悉尼靠到你身边。“昨晚有人陪我。”<<nnpc_he "Sydney">>对西里斯说，笑意却是留给你的。
    <<elseif _sydneyStatus.includes('pure')>>
      悉尼把灯笼放好。“昨晚多亏了你陪我。”<<nnpc_he "Sydney">>说，看起来很高兴你留了下来。
    <<else>>
      悉尼抱起书。“有人陪着，时间过得快多了。”<<nnpc_he "Sydney">>说。
    <</if>>
<</language>>
<br><br>
<<if Time.schoolDay>>
  <<schoolicon>><<lanLink ["Accept Sirris's ride to school (0:15)", '乘西里斯的车去学校 (0:15)'] 'Deadwood Reblooms Sydney Halloween Ride'>><<pass 15>><</lanLink>><br>
  <br>
  <<getouticon>><<lanLink ['See Sydney off with Sirris', '目送悉尼和西里斯去学校'] 'Temple'>><<endevent>><</lanLink>>
<<else>>
  <<templeicon 'altar'>><<lanLink ['Help Sydney with the morning duties (0:10)', '和悉尼准备晨间事务 (0:10)'] 'Deadwood Reblooms Sydney Dorm Morning Work'>><<pass 10>><<npcincr Sydney love 1>><</lanLink>><<glove>><br>
  <br>
  <<getouticon>><<lanLink ['See Sirris off', '送别西里斯'] 'Temple'>><<endevent>><</lanLink>>
<</if>>

:: Deadwood Reblooms Sydney Dorm Morning Work []
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'temple'>><<temple_effects>><<effects>>
<<npc Sydney>><<person1>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    Sirris leaves the breakfast with Sydney and heads back to the car. You help Sydney replace the spent candles and carry the empty lanterns away. By the time the first visitors arrive, the temple is ready for them.
    <br><br>
    "Thanks for staying," Sydney says, saving a piece of breakfast for you.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    西里斯把早餐交给悉尼，回到了车上。你帮悉尼换掉燃尽的蜡烛，收起空灯笼。第一批访客到来时，神殿已经收拾妥当。
    <br><br>
    “谢谢你留下来。”悉尼说，把早餐分了一份给你。
<</language>>
<br><br>
<<lanLink ["Continue","继续"] 'Temple'>><<endevent>><</lanLink>>

:: Deadwood Reblooms Sydney Halloween Ride []
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to 'school'>><<effects>>
<<npc Sydney 1>><<person1>><<npc Sirris 2>><<person2>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    Sirris drives through the quiet streets. Sydney dozes in the passenger seat until the school comes into view. Sirris glances over at <<nnpc_him "Sydney">> before pulling up.
    <br><br>
    "Don't forget your books," Sirris reminds Sydney. You step out together by the school gate.
    <br><br>
    <<if $sydneyromance is 1>>
      Sydney takes your hand and gives it a sleepy squeeze before you part.
    <<else>>
      Sydney gives you a drowsy wave.
    <</if>>
  <<option 'CN'>>
    西里斯开车穿过清晨安静的街道。悉尼在副驾驶座上打起盹，直到学校映入眼帘才睁开眼。西里斯看了<<nnpc_him "Sydney">>一眼，靠边停下。
    <br><br>
    “别忘了带书。”西里斯提醒悉尼。你们一起在学校门口下车。
    <br><br>
    <<if $sydneyromance is 1>>
      分开前，悉尼握住你的手，困倦地捏了捏。
    <<else>>
      悉尼困倦地向你挥了挥手。
    <</if>>
<</language>>
<br><br>
<<lanLink ["Continue","继续"] 'School Front Courtyard'>><<endevent>><</lanLink>>
